---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Free courses
description: Free, open-source Linux courses by Dr Haruna Adoga. RHCSA EX200 exam labs and a Linux server hardening series, with videos, for learners anywhere in the world.
permalink: /learn/
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
{% from "partials/courses.njk" import courseCards %}
{% from "partials/cards.njk" import videoCard %}

<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Free courses</p>
    <h1>Technical skills should be open to everyone.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Where you live or what you can pay should not decide whether you can learn to run serious infrastructure. So I publish what I teach: complete, hands-on courses on GitHub, with a video for every step on YouTube. They are free, and they will stay free.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    {{ courseCards(rhcsa, hardening) }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">How I teach</p><h2>Built for people who learn by doing.</h2></div></div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="card__num">01</div><h3>Hands-on first</h3><p>Every topic is a task you carry out on your own machine. You try it before you see the answer.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal" style="--d: 70ms"><div class="card__num">02</div><h3>Free tools only</h3><p>Everything runs on Rocky Linux, AlmaLinux or a free RHEL developer subscription, on a laptop with virtual machines.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal" style="--d: 140ms"><div class="card__num">03</div><h3>Open to correction</h3><p>The material is open source. If something is wrong or could be better, anyone can raise an issue or send a fix.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if youtube.length %}
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head reveal">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Latest lessons</p><h2>New on YouTube</h2></div>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.social.youtube }}?sub_confirmation=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subscribe {{ icon("ext") }}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {%- for v in youtube | limit(3) %}
      {{ videoCard(v) }}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="callout callout--accent cta reveal">
      <div>
        <h2>Teaching a class or a team?</h2>
        <p>You are welcome to use these courses with your students or colleagues. If you would like a guest session or a tailored version, get in touch.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/?topic=Training">Get in touch {{ icon("arrow") }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
